in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Barbería · Fairfield, CA · Desde 2010</p>\n    <h1>C&#39;s Cuts</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Fades limpios, delineados precisos y barberos que se toman su tiempo. La barbería del barrio en Fairfield desde 2010.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.8 · 135 reseñas en Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Llama para pasar</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=C&#39;s%20Cuts%2C%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%2C%20Fairfield%2C%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Cómo llegar</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>Desde 2010</li><li>Se atiende sin cita</li><li>Efectivo o Zelle</li><li>Cortes para niños</li><li>Estacionamiento privado</li><li>Accesible en silla de ruedas</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">La barbería</p><h2>Sin prisas. Solo un gran corte.</h2><p>C&#39;s Cuts (también conocida como C&#39;s Barber Shop) corta el pelo en North Texas Street desde 2010. Nuestras especialidades son cortes frescos, tapers, fades, crew cuts, recortes y delineados con navaja.</p><p>Chris, Christine y el resto del equipo nos tomamos nuestro tiempo, cuidamos cada detalle y es fácil platicar con nosotros. Muchos papás también traen a sus hijos.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.8★</b><span>135 reseñas</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>Sin cita</b><span>Bienvenidos</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>2010</b><span>Fundada</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Fade recién hecho en C&#39;s Cuts\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">En la silla</p><h2>Cortes y servicios</h2><p>Nuestras especialidades. Pídele a tu barbero lo que quieras a tu medida.</p></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Cortes frescos</h3></div><p>Tu corte de siempre, bien arreglado y con la forma que te gusta.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Fades</h3></div><p>Fades bajos, medios, altos y a rape, bien difuminados.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Tapers</h3></div><p>Tapers limpios en la nuca y las sienes.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Crew cuts</h3></div><p>Cortos, clásicos y fáciles de mantener.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Recortes</h3></div><p>Mantén tu largo y deja todo bien arreglado.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Delineado con navaja</h3></div><p>Contornos nítidos con acabado de navaja.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Cortes para niños</h3></div><p>Barberos pacientes con los pequeños (y con los papás exigentes).</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">No publicamos precios en línea. Llama al (707) 673-7601 para conocer los precios actuales. Pago: solo efectivo o Zelle.</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Bueno saber</p><h2>Antes de venir</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Se atiende sin cita</b></li><li><b>Efectivo o Zelle</b><span>No aceptamos tarjetas de crédito</span></li><li><b>Estacionamiento privado</b><span>Lote fuera de la calle, iluminado, con entradas por delante y por detrás</span></li><li><b>Estacionamiento para bicicletas</b></li><li><b>Accesible en silla de ruedas</b></li><li><b>Cortes para niños</b><span>Muchos papás traen a sus hijos</span></li><li><b>Fundada en 2010</b></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Galería</p><h2>Desde la barbería</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Skin fade con delineado preciso\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/textured-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Fade con la parte de arriba más larga y texturizada\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront.jpg\" alt=\"Fachada de C&#39;s Cuts en 2240 N Texas St\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront-2.jpg\" alt=\"Entrada de C&#39;s Cuts con poste de barbero\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Reseñas</p><h2>La silla favorita de Fairfield</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 135 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.5</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 34 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Yelp →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Woke up this morning took a quick glance in the mirror; and thought to myself &quot;Dam C!!!! you did a great job on the haircut....Thnx Bro!!&quot; Cya on the nxt1”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best haircut I’ve had in my two years in Cali and I’ll definitely be here every month. I recommend this shop to anyone who wants a legit cut for a legit price (don’t forget to tip). They make sure you’re not looking in the mirror afterwards wondering why you still go to them.”</blockquote><figcaption>— T&#39;Arris B. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Found my new go to barber in Fairfield. Chris and Christine are cool people, and all the barbers know what they’re doing. My first time I got a fresh fade from Christine. They take their time to give you the best cut for your money. Definitely recommend checking them out. Support your local Filipino shop!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Thomas A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Just got a cut from Chris and it was honestly one of the best I’ve had. He took his time, paid attention to every detail, and the fade came out super clean. The top was shaped perfectly, and you can tell he genuinely cares about his clients. He’s down to earth, easy to talk to, and really takes pride in what he does. If you’re looking for someone who doesn’t rush and delivers high-quality work, Chris is the one.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C’s Barbershop is great. I get my haircut by Chris. He’s a stand up guy — a great barber and friend. Always offers good conversation and takes pride in his craft. I always leave the shop feeling good about myself. My friend also gets his haircut by Chris’ wife, and she is talented as well. Affordable prices and great company has me coming back as a regular!”</blockquote><figcaption>— James R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C&#39;s cuts has been my go-to place for almost 15 years for my hair cut needs. The environment is always great, and well-rounded barbers with steady hands are always hard to find, especially ones for such a great price. I truly recommend everybody to get their cuts, line ups, and fades at C&#39;s. You won&#39;t regret how great you look and feel afterward”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Chris and Christine takes their time to cut my hair. They are both very skilled barbers. Highly recommended if you want a nice clean and sharp looking haircut. Hint: go to either Chris and Christine first for your first time haircut.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alexander C. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I’ve been coming to this place for a couple years now, and they’ve always been really kind and understanding. Before finding this place I had a really rough time finding someone who could cut my hair the way I like it, and by my surprise I found it down the street from me. 100/100 I’d recommend this place, and if you’re into a more chilled out vibe this is the place.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Aug 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I have two young boys and I can be very picky on who cuts their hair. I tend to have the usual people cut their hair but unfortunately none of them were available. I decided to go where my nephew always goes, C’s Barbershop. Let me just say that I’m very impressed !! Shoutout to the talented female who cut their hair! I wish I knew her name! I will definitely be bringing them back to her :)”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jeanette A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Preguntas frecuentes</p><h2>Tus preguntas, respondidas</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>¿Necesito cita?</summary><p>No, solo ven. Si prefieres hacer cita o quieres saber cuánto hay que esperar, llámanos al (707) 673-7601.</p></details><details><summary>¿Aceptan tarjetas de crédito?</summary><p>No aceptamos tarjetas de crédito. Aceptamos efectivo o Zelle.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuál es el horario?</summary><p>Abrimos de lunes a sábado, de 10 AM a 5 PM, y cerramos el domingo. El horario puede cambiar, así que llama antes.</p></details><details><summary>¿Dónde me estaciono?</summary><p>Tenemos un estacionamiento privado y dos entradas, una por delante y otra por detrás.</p></details><details><summary>¿Le cortan el pelo a niños?</summary><p>¡Sí! Muchos papás traen a sus hijos.</p></details><details><summary>¿Desde cuándo está abierta la barbería?</summary><p>Estamos abiertos desde 2010.</p></details><details><summary>¿La barbería es accesible en silla de ruedas?</summary><p>Sí, somos accesibles en silla de ruedas.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Visítanos</p>\n      <h2>Horario y ubicación</h2>\n      <address>2240 N Texas St<br>Fairfield, CA 94533</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-lin